= Prime-field separator-rank lead reconciliation
#text(fill: rgb("475569"))[2026-11-01 · search and implementation report · no scientific run]

== Outcome

The requested next discriminator was separator rank or small-root growth as relation arity increases, with special-prime structure as a second lead. The repository already preregisters the more faithful separator experiment: contract the actual hashed Boolean network at a semantic cut and compute exact balanced flattening ranks against topology-preserving rewired nulls.

This round implemented the missing exact census core. It did not generate an E1 row. The protocol stays draft until production cuts, matched nulls, fresh-process A/A, power, resource limits and image identities are frozen.

